  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Father A Nation: Prevention of Gender-Based Violence and bullying in schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to educate, create awareness and inspire practical action amongst learners and educators in the targeted schools to reduce gender-based violence, bullying and any form of abuse. The goal is for this to have an impact not only in the targeted schools but in the communities they serve.</narrative>
  </description>
